## ✅ Key Fixes & Improvements

| Fix | Explanation |
|-----|-------------|
| ✅ **Only assign `set` to `data.tosk` if it's safe** | Ensure `getTask` class has a public `Task Tsk` property that can be serialized. |
| ✅ **Avoid modifying `set` in-place without saving** | Use `await _context.SaveChangesAsync()` only when needed and ensure `set` is properly tracked. |
| ✅ **Use `Array.IndexOf` safely** | With `.Where()` to avoid nulls. |
| ✅ **Add fallbacks** | If lists are empty, fallback to first item. |
| ✅ **Avoid `Random()` in async methods** | Use `new Random()` — but only once per call. |
| ✅ **Fix `checkagain.StaticImg.ToString()`** | Only call if `checkagain != null`. |
| ✅ **Fix `compare.Last()`** | Add `.Count > 0` check. |
| ✅ **Fix `statpath` in `text` type** | Was missing. |
| ✅ **Better flow and readability** | Nested `if-else` is now structured clearly. |
| ✅ **Proper error handling** | `NotFound`, `BadRequest`, `NullReference` avoided. |

